 140 handcrafted tickets. Every decision can shape propaganda, public opinion, future events, and the people living in your grid.Every major request in Directive 220 is handcrafted.A single ticket is much more than a simple power request. Depending on your decision, it can trigger directives, propaganda broadcasts, newspaper articles and even reactive phone calls later in the game.This screenshot shows the internal tool I use to build and review every n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T19:14:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4596210-1832065502823249","game_id":"steam-4596210","kind":"announcement","title":"About Directive 220","summary":"I also believe it is fair to be transparent about the scope of the project and the expectations around it.Directive 220 is my first game project. I have spent most of my life playing games and always wanted to create and release one myself someday. This project is essentially that long-term personal goal finally becoming real.Directive 220 is a narrative-focused indie game built by a single developer with extremely limited time and resources. The project is developed mostly after work during lim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T08:36:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502823249","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4596210-1832065502819025","game_id":"steam-4596210","kind":"announcement","title":"Every Ticket Has A Story","summary":"Power requests are no longer just numbers on a chart.Some requests now arrive with political pressure attached. Government officials, local authorities, and party representatives may intervene directly in daily planning — forcing players to balance grid stability against social and political consequences.The latest internal builds introduce a new narrative directive system where major tickets can carry their own stories, priorities, and hidden risks.Players may now encounter:politically sensitiv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-10T09:36:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502819025","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4596210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4596210":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4596210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4738870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:56:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
